= Workers’ rights

Labour enforces the law on working time and oversees agreements between employers and unions. An inspection is a small reform: one decision, 1 B for two months of building, then 1 B to run. Its law goes to the Sejm and the Senate in the same decision. A collective agreement and a derogation cost the budget nothing.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

[+ pl_gc_plants +]

