@inspection
title: Inspection and enforcement of working time
subtitle: Protection rises one level once it works; costs the budget 1 unit a month for two months, then 1 unit a month. Needs the law.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'labor_rights', 'inspection').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_labor_rights_inspection_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'labor_rights', 'inspection');
!}
go-to: result

@collective
title: Collective agreements
subtitle: This month's action, nothing from the budget: the employers who sign pay. Wages rise once through the economy, with no reaction of business.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'labor_rights', 'collective').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_labor_rights_collective_why +]
go-to: collective_menu

@collective_menu
new-page: true

= Collective agreements

A collective agreement of one branch records its employers, the union, the covered workers, the wage conditions and a term of twelve months. Its wage effect is that of a settled wage clause: +2 pp times the branch's scope, for two months. A branch in an open dispute settles its wages there instead.

- @collective_industry
- @collective_rail
- @collective_farm_labour
- @polish_gov_labor_rights: Back to the card.

